WEBVTT

00:00:01.337 --> 00:00:04.007
So he could get past that dog.

00:00:04.215 --> 00:00:06.968
But he got bit,
that's why he's limping.

00:00:07.218 --> 00:00:09.429
But why would anyone go near that dog?

00:00:10.096 --> 00:00:13.349
At gringotts, Hagrid took
something out of the vault.

00:00:13.516 --> 00:00:16.811
Said it was Hogwarts business,
very secret.

00:00:16.978 --> 00:00:18.146
Hermione: You're saying...

00:00:18.354 --> 00:00:22.859
That's what the dog's guarding.
That's what Snape wants.

00:00:35.997 --> 00:00:39.959
- Bit early for mail, isn't it?
- But I never get mail.

00:00:40.501 --> 00:00:42.045
Let's open it.

00:00:52.221 --> 00:00:53.473
Harry: It's a broomstick.

00:00:54.265 --> 00:00:58.394
That's not just a broomstick,
it's a nimbus 2000!

00:00:59.854 --> 00:01:01.898
But who...?

00:01:23.544 --> 00:01:26.047
- Scared, Harry?
- A little.

00:01:26.255 --> 00:01:29.926
It's all right. I felt the same way
before my first game.

00:01:30.093 --> 00:01:33.596
- What happened?
- I don't really remember.

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:36.599
I took a bludger to the head
two minutes in.

00:01:36.808 --> 00:01:39.602
Woke up in hospital a week later.

00:02:01.833 --> 00:02:05.211
Welcome to Hogwarts' first
Quidditch game of the season.

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:09.799
Today's game,
Slytherin versus Gryffindor!

00:02:14.971 --> 00:02:16.806
Gryffindor!

00:02:40.413 --> 00:02:42.874
Lee:
The players take their positions...

00:02:43.082 --> 00:02:46.878
As madam hooch steps onto
the field to begin the game!

00:02:47.086 --> 00:02:50.423
Now, I want a nice, clean game...

00:02:51.007 --> 00:02:53.468
From all of you!

00:02:58.598 --> 00:03:01.517
Lee: The bludgers are up,
followed by the golden snitch.

00:03:01.684 --> 00:03:04.437
Remember, the snitch
is worth 150 points.

00:03:04.645 --> 00:03:08.441
The seeker who catches the snitch
ends the game.

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:18.701
The quaffle is released
and the game begins!

00:03:37.386 --> 00:03:42.183
Angelina Johnson scores!
Ten points for Gryffindor!

00:03:44.435 --> 00:03:46.687
Yes... whoa.

00:03:53.027 --> 00:03:58.741
Lee: Slytherin takes the quaffle.
Bletchley passes to captain Marcus flint.

00:04:30.064 --> 00:04:33.568
- Yes!
- Another 10 points to Gryffindor!

00:04:47.373 --> 00:04:49.250
Give me that!

00:05:20.656 --> 00:05:23.326
Take that side!

00:06:12.792 --> 00:06:16.045
Hagrid: What's going on
with Harry's broomstick?

00:06:24.971 --> 00:06:27.181
It's Snape.
He's jinxing the broom!

00:06:27.390 --> 00:06:31.727
- Jinxing the broom? What do we do?
- Leave it to me.

00:06:53.541 --> 00:06:55.084
Come on, Hermione!

00:07:09.181 --> 00:07:12.935
Lacarnum lnflamarae.

00:07:20.026 --> 00:07:23.070
Man: Fire! You're on fire!

00:07:40.921 --> 00:07:43.090
Go, go, go, go!

00:08:35.101 --> 00:08:37.436
Looks like he's gonna be sick.

00:08:38.521 --> 00:08:39.980
Lee: He's got the snitch!

00:08:40.189 --> 00:08:44.276
Harry Potter receives 150 points
for catching the snitch!

00:08:44.485 --> 00:08:46.153
Gryffindor wins!

